    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Tears Rain]</h2><br>Tears Rain, a purple rain that has been passed down in legend, has begun to soak the world.<br>The powerful energy contained in the raindrops made the monsters strong and ferocious, and soon the monsters started attacking humans mercilessly.<br>Moreover, even the goddess, who was the hope of humans, suddenly disappeared.<br><br>To restore peace, Rantz and his friends arrive at the Forest of Illusion in pursuit of the last traces of the goddess.<br>Can they find the goddess through this strange forest full of monsters?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Active Turn TCG]</h2><br><i>&quot; Collect cards to build powerful decks. &quot;</i><br>In this forest full of enemies, the only things I can count on are my friends and the cards in my hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/1b962c706b8ebc9648822d1d88816eca.poster.avif?t=1719497954\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/1b962c706b8ebc9648822d1d88816eca.webm?t=1719497954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/1b962c706b8ebc9648822d1d88816eca.mp4?t=1719497954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/56f8037709050b9ef52f200c84c1c680.poster.avif?t=1719497954\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/56f8037709050b9ef52f200c84c1c680.webm?t=1719497954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284530/extras/56f8037709050b9ef52f200c84c1c680.mp4?t=1719497954\" type=\"video/mp4\"